Scoped maskedmin and maskedmax video filters

The option table, three-input pads, pix_fmts list, size check, plane mask,
maskedmin8/maskedmax8 selection (filter2 when its absolute difference from the
source is strictly smaller, respectively larger, than filter1's; filter1 on
ties), unselected-plane copy from the source and output timestamp in
src/video-maskedminmax.ts, src/video-ops/maskedmin.ts and
src/video-ops/maskedmax.ts follow libavfilter/vf_maskedminmax.c
(maskedminmax_options, maskedmin_init, pix_fmts, MASKED, config_input,
maskedminmax_slice, process_frame, config_output, maskedminmax_inputs).
